# The render sets ARE the record: sets/<round>-<sha7>-<backend>/ is tracked
# file-by-file, together with its INDEX.tsv row, in a single commit. (They were
# published as sets-<round>.tar.gz release assets until 2026-11-22; nothing
# consumed those, and an upload that failed left an INDEX row naming a set no
# one could retrieve.)
#
# Only the nightly run's transient log is ignored, so a crashed round cannot be
# committed by accident.
.nightly-render.log
